WithdrawAll_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
└── when market allowlisted
   ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
   │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
   └── given known market
      ├── given vault has no supply position
      │  └── it should revert with NoPosition
      └── given vault has supply position
         ├── given Morpho not authorized for adapter
         │  └── it should revert in Morpho with not authorized
         └── given Morpho authorized
            ├── it should read live supplyShares
            ├── it should call morpho.withdraw with shares equal to live supply
            ├── it should set onBehalf equal to vault
            ├── it should set receiver equal to vault
            ├── it should transfer loan token to vault
            └── it should leave vault supplyShares at zero
